"P4066719953" "Ranged (Narrow Cone), High DMG (Lethal), Minor DoT(Lethal/Toxic), -DMG(Foe, All), -RES(Foe, All), Special"
// Power Help Text :
"P3180830076" "You take aim and fire a single, powerful round at your target, piercing through any defenses they may have. The target suffers lethal damage from the initial shot, then additional lethal damage from their wound. The target is also exhausted, suffering reduced resistance to damage, regeneration and recovery. If the target is also a designated target, additional lethal damage is done."
