// Power Help Text :
"P3956898821" "You fire a well aimed round at your target. This round strikes the target in a vulnerable spot, causing lethal damage and staggering them. The affected target is stunned and suffers reduced damage, defense, healing and chance to hit. If the target is also a designated target, additional lethal damage is done."
